  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MCD core standing team costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MCD core costs for the Humanitarian, Stabilisation Operations Team under the HEROS contract. Core costs cover HSOT personnel, milestones, reimbursables and surge costs which is integral to the operation of the HEROS programme which deploys consultants to developing countries to assist on a variety of topics.</narrative>
  </description>
